WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.893
Camotán plot. A computer voice is reading this.

2
00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:12.399
In March and April, your land usually has little plant cover. The satellite saw it from 2021 to 2025.

3
00:00:12.649 --> 00:00:18.946
In 3 of the last 15 years there were fires within half a kilometer of your plot, in March and April.

4
00:00:19.196 --> 00:00:25.943
In 2 of the last 25 years, the midsummer drought brought more than 15 days in a row with almost no rain.

5
00:00:26.193 --> 00:00:40.022
This year, July and August got only a quarter of the normal rain (26 %). That is less than in 2018, the driest year since 1991. It is a preliminary figure.

6
00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:44.801
We can't say which option is best: SMAP soil moisture is missing.

7
00:00:45.051 --> 00:00:49.040
This is not an official notice: talk it over with your extension worker.
